d visual tells a story of creation, chaos, and redemption. Crafted with cutting-edge 360\u00b0 visuals and a stunning original score, Pandora\u2019s Box invites audiences to step into a realm where sound and vision merge, challenging the boundaries of reality and art.\n\nWe have established the very first film in 12K raw true 360\u00b0 VR / AR with the first real live action musicians and performers composited into the imaginative evolving story. Reaching this stage is a remarkable achievement and a historic one, as we push the boundaries of what\u2019s possible in immersive media. We\u2019re thrilled to be at the forefront of this innovation. ", "short_description": "Pandora\u2019s Box is a blended world of reality and imagination, where world class artists give next level performances as an entire 360\u00b0 story evolves around the score of music. A 40 minute, fully immersive concert experience, that transports the audience through wildly imaginative worlds and music\u2026 unveiling a neo-classical journey where every note and visual tells a story of creation, chaos, and redemption. Crafted with cutting-edge 360\u00b0 visuals and a stunning original score."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bwai_OWJxTtwAuz-D1J58cmN369TxekHnsa85db81-U/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "La Pandora Distribution, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.cervomediagroupinc.com/pandoras-box", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"]